{"id":"n15214-1-7","stage":4,"title":"여전하다 · 依旧","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15214-1-7-1","ko":"넌 몇 년이 지났어도 미모는 여전하구나.","zh":"就算过了这么多年，你的美貌依然如故啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"년이","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년이","audio":"/audio/c66de169640c62288efd.mp3"}},{"text":"지났어도","meaning":"过，过去","explanation":"지나다：过，过去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지났어도","audio":"/audio/d5d451567e6aa72cd0b5.mp3"}},{"text":"미모는","meaning":"美貌","explanation":"미모：美貌；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"미모","audio":"/audio/02fc885b61db44a8b197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56331","senseId":"1","lemma":"미모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미모는","audio":"/audio/526e7eaff9af9c02d8b9.mp3"}},{"text":"여전하구나.","meaning":"依旧，依然","explanation":"여전하다：依旧，依然；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"여전하다","audio":"/audio/4939ae57cbab6b5a501a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15214","senseId":"1","lemma":"여전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여전하구나","audio":"/audio/26c12a15e1a3faf06e17.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"7d68e3b7dc1c001c","term":"지나다","zh":"过，过去","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3","entryId":"82142","definition":"随时间流逝，脱离那个时期。","pronunciation":["지나다"]},{"id":"02fc885b61db44a8","term":"미모","zh":"美貌","audio":"/audio/02fc885b61db44a8b197.mp3","entryId":"56331","definition":"长得漂亮的容貌。","pronunciation":["미ː모"]},{"id":"4939ae57cbab6b5a","term":"여전하다","zh":"依旧，依然","audio":"/audio/4939ae57cbab6b5a501a.mp3","entryId":"15214","definition":"与以前一样。","pronunciation":["여전하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/df452e7da003794e230a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15214-1-7-2","ko":"아냐, 나도 많이 늙었어.","zh":"不，我也老了很多呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아냐,","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아냐：不是，不对。","readings":[{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65977","senseId":"1","lemma":"아냐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아냐","audio":"/audio/775fa206224d591e4b76.mp3"}},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI